10
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.740
I looked around and I always am worried

11
00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:32.800
my alarm is gonna wake up my two daughters,

12
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:34.580
'cause they were sleeping with me

13
00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.450
and my alarm went off and I looked around

14
00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:42.290
and I had my two daughters and then our cat, Lucky,

15
00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:45.640
our cat, Peach, Lucy and Douglas

16
00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:46.473
and there was just,

17
00:00:46.473 --> 00:00:48.980
it looked like we were sleeping in Noah's Ark

18
00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:53.980
and it was the most cozy, beautiful moment

19
00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:57.710
